{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39397","headline":"长安春 · 韦庄","name":"长安春","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长安二月多香尘，六街车马声辚辚。\n家家楼上如花人，千枝万枝红艳新。\n帘间笑语自相问，何人占得长安春。\n长安春色本无主，古来尽属红楼女。\n如今无奈杏园人，骏马轻车拥将去。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39397.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39397","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}